<title>USA: PHLX to list Verilink options on July 18.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Verilink options on July 18.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange will trade Verilink Corp options on July 18, joining the other three options exchanges, the exchange said Monday.</p>
<p>The options will have strike prices of 7-1/2, 10 and 12-1/2, with expirations in August, September, October and January.</p>
<p>Verilink shares were up 1/16 at 10-9/16 Monday morning.</p>
<p>The PHLX said position limits of 10,500 contracts have been set and that Group One Ltd will be the specialist unit.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
